  "card_text": "[Field] (Place and activate this card in your Battle Area. It remains in your Battle Area until you activate another [Field]. When you do, place this card in its owner's Drop Area.)<br>[Energy-Exhaust] (If this card is placed in an Energy Area from any area, it must be placed there in Rest Mode.)<br>[Auto] When this card is placed in your Battle Area and your Leader Card is a 〈King Vegeta〉 card, choose up to 1 《Saiyan》 card with an energy cost of 2 or less in your hand, and play it with its skills negated for the duration of the turn. If you played a card, draw 2 cards.<br>[Auto] When your opponent attacks with a card, you may choose 1 red card in your Energy Area, switch it to Rest Mode, and place this card in its owner's Drop Area. If you do, negate the attack.",
